# List one file per line relative to the repository root. Run
# `ninja -C _build nexus-pot` (meson's i18n.gettext target) to regenerate
# po/nexus.pot from these.
#
# NOTE (see docs/LIMITATIONS.md): the GTK UI scaffold does not yet wrap
